            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$3x^2-2x-1=3(x-1)^2+4(x-1)$.\n\nWrite $x=(x-1)+1$ and expand the outer brackets.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2-2x-1&=3\\big((x-1)^2+2(x-1)+1\\big)-2\\big((x-1)+1\\big)-1\\\\3x^2-2x-1&=3(x-1)^2+(6-2)(x-1)+(3-2-1)\\\\3x^2-2x-1&=3(x-1)^2+4(x-1).\\end{align*}$$",
